{"a":["قُلۡ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ","ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ","لَمۡ يَلِدۡ وَلَمۡ يُولَدۡ","وَلَمۡ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدُۢ"],"i":["Katakanlah (Muhammad), \"Dialah Allah, Yang Maha Esa","Allah tempat meminta segala sesuatu","(Allah) tidak beranak dan tidak pula diperanakkan","Dan tidak ada sesuatu yang setara dengan Dia"],"e":["Say, \"He is Allah, [who is] One","Allah, the Eternal Refuge","He neither begets nor is born","Nor is there to Him any equivalent"],"t":["Qul huwa Allahu ahadun","Allahu alssamadu","Lam yalid walam yooladu","Walam yakun lahu kufuwan ahadun"]}